"description":"Apple Music is all about the music, with the highest audio quality; exclusive, in-depth content and unparalleled access to the artists you love–all ad-free.\n\n• Get unlimited access to over 100 million songs.\n• Playlists & stations made just for you. Find your Discovery Station, personalized picks, mixes, and more on Home.\n• Precise, beat-by-beat lyrics now include translations and pronunciations on many of your favorite songs to help you sing along with confidence.(1)\n• Take your listening to the next level with AutoMix. Like a DJ, AutoMix seamlessly transitions one song into the next.\n• Hear next-level sound quality with Spatial Audio(2) and lossless audio.(3)\n• Go deeper with the artists you love through in-depth interviews, live performances, and exclusive radio shows created by the most iconic names in music, and only found on Apple Music.\n• Find concerts in your area and tour dates for your favorite artists.\n• Keep the music going with AutoPlay for a continuous listening experience.\n• With Apple Music Sing, turn down the vocal volume and sing along with your favorite songs. And now you can pair your iPhone to an Apple TV to use as a microphone. It’s not karaoke... it’s better.\n• Listen with friends in real time using SharePlay, and control the music together in the car.\n• Share the music you love. Invite friends to collaborate on playlists,(4) join listening sessions with SharePlay, even share the lyrics that move you in Messages.\n• Download your favorite music, and listen offline.\n• Search for songs by lyrics, or ask Siri.\n• Take it all with you using CarPlay, and use your car controls to search for music.\n\nApple Watch Features:\n\n• Download and stream music straight to your Apple Watch.\n• Search for music using scribble and dictation.\n• Use Home to quickly get back to your recently played, suggested stations, top picks and more. \n• Sort your favorite playlist, albums, and songs by your preference, right from your wrist.\n\n1. Lyrics Translation and Lyrics Pronunciation is available for select songs in select languages and scripts.\n2. Compatible hardware and software required. Not all content available in Spatial Audio with Dolby Atmos.\n3. Lossless audio available up to 24-bit/192 kHz. Hi-Res Lossless requires external equipment such as a USB digital to analog converter.\n4. Users under the age of 13 cannot collaborate on playlists because they are not allowed to have identities within Music. Users in Cameroon, China mainland, Malawi, Mali, Russia, Türkiye, United Arab Emirates, and Uruguay cannot collaborate.\n\nAvailability and features vary by country and region, plan, or device. To get the newest features, make sure your devices are running the latest software version. Subscriptions automatically renew unless they are canceled at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel your subscriptions in Settings after purchase. Apple Media Services Terms and Conditions can be found at https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/.", "fileSizeBytes":"9944064", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":3264883, "trackContentRating":"12+", "bundleId":"com.apple.Music", 
